      bestLabel: "LE GOLFE WOULD PICK IT FOR", bestItems: ["An important occasion", "Serious food travellers", "Couples", "An evening entirely built around dinner"], lessLabel: "KNOW BEFORE YOU CHOOSE", lessItems: ["High budget", "Not for a quick dinner", "Book well ahead"],
